{"id": "79ad53b4-3a23-4fac-9397-5eef53ba5b25", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "I'll check your SageMaker processing jobs in us-east-1. For each job, I'll look at whether a KMS key is set on its ML storage volume. Because there could be many jobs, I'm running the scan in the background.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "tooluse_PGbJudEJ0ybPvafGpW6evF", "tool_name": "subagent", "input": {"name": "sm-processing-ebs-kms-check", "agent_type": "generic", "prompt": "{
  "task": "Determine, for every SageMaker processing job in us-east-1, whether the ML storage (EBS) volume attached to the job is encrypted with a customer-specified KMS key.",
  "context": "User asks: 'Are the EBS volumes of my SageMaker processing jobs in us-east-1 encrypted with a KMS key?'. In SageMaker, processing job volumes are configured via ProcessingResources.ClusterConfig.VolumeKmsKeyId (describe_processing_job). If VolumeKmsKeyId is absent, the volume is not encrypted with a customer-supplied KMS key (note: SageMaker may still apply default/service-managed encryption of the storage volume; mention this nuance briefly in your report). Use read-only operations only: sagemaker list_processing_jobs (paginate fully, all statuses) and describe_processing_job for each job. Use jmespath filters to keep output small (e.g. only ProcessingJobName, ProcessingJobStatus, CreationTime, ProcessingResources.ClusterConfig.VolumeKmsKeyId, VolumeSizeInGB).",
  "resources": ["Agent space account 012345678901_1, region us-east-1. Also check other associated AWS accounts via list_associations if any exist, passing aws_account_id for each."],
  "timeframe": "All jobs SageMaker still retains (no filter), noting the oldest and newest creation time seen.",
  "criteria": "Report: total jobs scanned per account; count with a KMS key vs without; list of job names WITHOUT a KMS key (cap at ~25 names, with counts if more) and the distinct KMS key ARNs/IDs in use with counts; any jobs that could not be described and why. If zero jobs exist, say so. Keep the report concise."
}"}, "type": "tool_use", "display_intent": "Scan SageMaker processing jobs for volume KMS encryption"}], "created_at": null}

